<p>1) The ethical and legal implications should be handled elsewhere. You may want to look at the admin panel to see who to discuss that with.</p>
<p>2) Details rock. There are some questions about what happens when he shifts to a new anime world; does he transform into a native or does he resemble himself? Would he gain power armor if he shifted to a mecha universe, or be in medieval wear if in an isekai anime? Would he gain powers in a superhero universe?</p>
<p>3) Why go meta? It's not a bad idea, but just because he can shift to different universes doesn't mean he needs to have a meta-perspective. I get the Deadpool connection, but unless you have an actual purpose for it, it just feels sort of tacked on. Also, his abilities don't exactly beg for it. It just feels like you want to do an anime thing on one hand and different realities on the other (and I'm not sure the SCP needs yet another dimension-hopper).</p>

